TITLE Equilibration of 1 kg pure water at 150C with fixed-pressure gas phase

SOLUTION 1
    temp      150
    pH        7
    pe        4
    units     mol/kgw
    water     1  # kg

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure    1.0
    -temperature 150
    -volume      1.0
    CH4(g)       10.0
    CO2(g)       10.0
    NH3(g)        5.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file        sim_gas_equilibration.sel
    -reset       false
    -gas         CH4(g) CO2(g) NH3(g)

END
